# Driver UI Deployment Structure

This directory is the DEVELOPMENT SOURCE OF TRUTH for driver-ui resources.

Layout:

- driver-ui/postgres/
  - registration-ui.exe
  - driver-postgres.exe
- driver-ui/joywatcher/
  - registration-ui.exe
  - driver-joywatcher.exe
  - joywatcher-bridge-x86.exe

Rules:

- Install build artifacts here first.
- Stage to src-tauri/driver-ui/ only via stage scripts.
- Do not treat src-tauri/driver-ui/ as source of truth.

See docs/driver-development.md for add-new-driver procedure.
